    <item>
      <title>KiCon, Look out for FreeCAD content!</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/kicon-look-out-for-freecad-content/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/kicon-look-out-for-freecad-content/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;We have a great relationship with many opensource projects non more so than KiCad. As such we&amp;rsquo;d like to take this opportunity to highlight that this years &lt;a href=&#34;https://kicon.kicad.org/na2025/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;KiCon North America&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is taking place in a little over 14 days. This time it&amp;rsquo;s in San Diego CA in the Qualcomm institute.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FreeCAD Day 2025</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-day-2025/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 16 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-day-2025/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Each year on the Friday before the FOSDEM event, FreeCAD held a &amp;ldquo;FreeCAD Day&amp;rdquo; where, after working for a few days directly on FreeCAD in a hackathon style, the day is set up as an Un-conference meaning any presentation or activity can be attached to the agenda. It&amp;rsquo;s a lovely format that allows for really interesting things to happen. Again this year the pre FOSDEM FreeCAD Day took place in the Ateliers Des Tanneurs building which we share with the KiCad team for a few days before FOSDEM.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FreeCAD at FOSDEM 2025</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem-2025/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 10 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem-2025/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;image-with-popover&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;        &lt;button aria-label=&#34;Zoom image&#34; popovertarget=&#34;img-001&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img srcset=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem-2025/IMG_20250202_163750_hu_9211367fb6ebe11f.webp 500w, https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem-2025/IMG_20250202_163750_hu_76a96f552d362612.webp 1000w, https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem-2025/IMG_20250202_163750.jpg 4000w&#34;&#xA;            sizes=&#34;(max-width: 500px) 500px, (max-width: 1000px) 1000px, 75vw&#34;&#xA;            src=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem-2025/IMG_20250202_163750.jpg&#34;&#xA;            width=&#34;4000&#34;&#xA;            height=&#34;2248&#34;&#xA;            title=&#34;FreeCAD at FOSDEM 2025 1&#34;&#xA;            alt=&#34;Image&#34;&#xA;            loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;            fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;FreeCAD at FOSDEM 2025 1&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div id=&#34;img-001&#34; popover&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img src=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem-2025/IMG_20250202_163750.jpg&#34;&#xA;            title=&#34;FreeCAD at FOSDEM 2025 1&#34;&#xA;            alt=&#34;Image&#34;&#xA;            loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;            fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;button class=&#34;close&#34;&#xA;            popovertarget=&#34;img-001&#34;&#xA;            popovertargetaction=&#34;hide&#34;&#xA;            aria-label=&#34;Close image viewer&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;icon-cross&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M4 20 20 4M4 4 20 20&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Last weekend was&lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org/2025/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt; FOSDEM&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; where a huge cohort of the opensource community descend on Brussels and take over the Solbosch campus of the Université Libre de &lt;em&gt;Bruxelles&lt;/em&gt;. It&amp;rsquo;s a fantastic event and, of course, FreeCAD had a stand alongside our friends and colleagues &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.kicad.org/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;KiCad&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, as well a numerous FreeCAD related speakers and talks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FOSDEM and KiCAD &#43; FreeCAD day 2025</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/fosdem-and-kicad-freecad-day-2025/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/fosdem-and-kicad-freecad-day-2025/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;It&amp;rsquo;s happening again! &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Fosdem&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM 2025&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; has been announced and, like the previous years, the &lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FPA&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; are thrilled to organise once again our world-famous &lt;strong&gt;FreeCAD events&lt;/strong&gt;. These will take place in Brussels, from January 28th to February the 2nd 2025, together with FOSDEM. Be ready for several days full of coding, open-sourceness and fun!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>North America FreeCAD Meetup August 2024.</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/north-america-freecad-meetup-august-2024/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/north-america-freecad-meetup-august-2024/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Between August the 15&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; and 18&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; Springfield Illinois played host to a North American FreeCAD meetup. This excellent event drew together a group of active FreeCAD contributors for a 4 day hackathon, incorporating various meetings, presentations and, of course, social activities.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Quick intro to FreeCAD programming</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/quick-intro-to-freecad-programming/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/quick-intro-to-freecad-programming/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Ajinkya Dahale and Yorik van Havre recently did a live introduction to FreeCAD programming for participants of &lt;a href=&#34;https://fossunited.org/fosshack/2024&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSS Hack 2024&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, an upcoming hackathon that aims to promote conribution to FOSS software.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The FreeCAD day 2024</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/the-freecad-day-2024/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/the-freecad-day-2024/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This year again, the &lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FPA&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; organized a FreeCAD day and a hackathon (and &lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.freecad.org/2023/10/31/fosdem-freecad-day-and-hackathon-2024/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;much more&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;!) together with &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, in Brussels. We had an incredible, epic week of events (which you&amp;rsquo;ll know all about later on this blog). I&amp;rsquo;ll describe here briefly what happened during the hackathon and the FreeCAD day.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FOSDEM, FreeCAD day and hackathon 2024</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/fosdem-freecad-day-and-hackathon-2024/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 31 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/fosdem-freecad-day-and-hackathon-2024/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is coming soon and the &lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FPA&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is already planning to make our corresponding FreeCAD event bigger and better than last year. FOSDEM happens in Brussels on Saturday February 3rd and Sunday February 4th, 2024. We propose to,&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C0u1FBUsILE&amp;amp;lc=UgzpDh_0yfrwfINIbr14AaABAg&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt; once again&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, realize a public FreeCAD day, open to all,&lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unconference&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt; unconference&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; style, and a hackathon, also open to anyone interested but focused on doing actual coding, together with FOSDEM.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Vancouver Hackathon Wrap-up</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/vancouver-hackathon-wrap-up/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/vancouver-hackathon-wrap-up/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;As I write this we are just wrapping up the &lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.freecad.org/2023/05/24/freecad-hackathon-11-13-august-2023/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FreeCAD Hackathon 2023&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in Vancouver, BC. The coffee is gone, the laptop batteries are drained, and everyone present (physically and virtually) is winding up their weekend projects.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
