      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-meetup-at-fosdem-2023/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org/2023/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;Free and Open Source Developers&amp;rsquo; European Meeting (FOSDEM) 2023&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is being held on 4 &amp;amp; 5 February 2023 in Brussels: many FreeCAD developers and users are meeting at the event, and a dedicated FreeCAD meetup is planned for the preceding Friday, 3 February 2023.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
